@prefix c: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/> .
@prefix v: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/> .

c:nelson-oppen-combination v:uses c:theory-solver .
c:nelson-oppen-combination v:uses c:theory-purification .
c:nelson-oppen-combination v:requiresAssumption c:stable-infiniteness .
c:nelson-oppen-combination v:requiresAssumption c:disjoint-theory-signatures .
c:proof-checker v:uses c:proof-certificate .
c:proof-term v:represents c:formal-derivation .
